<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Record Not Found</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0;padding:0;height:100vh;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e3a8a,#2563eb,#38bdf8);font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Geneva,Verdana,sans-serif;overflow:hidden;">

<div style="width:470px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);border-radius:28px;padding:45px;text-align:center;box-shadow:0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.45);animation:zoom .7s ease;">

    <!-- Search Icon -->
    <div style="width:120px;height:120px;margin:auto;border-radius:50%;background:#ffffff;display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;font-size:60px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(255,255,255,.35);color:#2563eb;">
        🔍
    </div>

    <h1 style="margin-top:28px;font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;letter-spacing:1px;">
        Record Not Found
    </h1>

    <div style="width:90px;height:4px;background:#38bdf8;margin:18px auto;border-radius:10px;"></div>

    <p style="font-size:17px;color:#e5e7eb;line-height:30px;margin-top:18px;">
        We searched everywhere, but couldn't find the record you requested.
        It may have been deleted, moved, or never existed.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top:35px;">

        <a href="javascript:history.back()"
        style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:#ffffff;color:#2563eb;padding:15px 35px;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;border-radius:50px;box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(255,255,255,.3);margin-right:10px;">
            ← Go Back
        </a>

        <a href="/"
        style="display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;background:transparent;color:#fff;border:2px solid #fff;padding:13px 30px;font-size:17px;font-weight:bold;border-radius:50px;">
            Home
        </a>

    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:30px;color:#cbd5e1;font-size:14px;">
        Please verify your search or try again with different information.
    </div>

</div>

<style>

@keyframes zoom{
    0%{
        transform:scale(.6) translateY(40px);
        opacity:0;
    }
    100%{
        transform:scale(1) translateY(0);
        opacity:1;
    }
}

a{
    transition:.35s;
}

a:hover{
    transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.04);
}

</style>

</body>
</html>